摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (dsh) bundle: when `dsh web` is ready, print the full GUI URL and open it in your default browser. Cross-platform, zero runtime deps, fail-safe.","id":"gh:1333891353","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-open","slug":"dawsondx/dsh-web-open","topics":["automation","browser","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (dsh) bundle: when `dsh web` is ready, print the full GUI URL and open it in your d"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"efault browser. Cross-platform, zero runtime deps, fail-safe."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"### 兼容性与更新策略"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"这个插件**故意**只依赖稳定层："},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| 依赖 | 稳定性 | 失效时会怎样 |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| `@deepseek-ai/cordis`（peer，`>=4.0.0`） | 稳定的插件核心，独立版本号 | 插件无法加载 → dsh 有明确报错，移除插件即恢复 |\n| dsh 内部服务 `l"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"oader` / `webServer` | 0.1.0-rc 阶段可能改名 | **降级为 no-op**：只打一行 warning，`dsh web` 照常启动，只是不自动打开 |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"#### 已知的真实风险（写清楚比藏着好）"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- 若 dsh 官方把 `loader` / `webServer` 服务改名（rc 阶段完全可能），本插件需要一次小更新（改两个服务名）；期间表现为\"不自动打开\"，不影响使用。\n- 若官方未来原生支"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"持 `--open`，本插件可以退役（卸载即可）；为了不撞车，本插件**故意不用 CLI 参数**，只用 profile 配置控制。\n- 恢复/卸载：`dsh plugin --profile web"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" remove @dawsondx/dsh-web-open`，或直接编辑 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` 的 bundles 列表。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 跨平台兼容性（第一性原理审查）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"结论：**可以跨平台安装并正确运行**（Windows / macOS / Linux，含 WSL）。以下逐层对照 dsh 0.1.0-rc.6 实际源码验证过，不是想当然："},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 层 | 实际机制（源码依据） | 结论 |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| 安装 | `dsh plugin --profile web add <包>` → pnpm 装入 profile → **命令内 reconcile** 把声明了 `dsh.bundle` 的包"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"写进 `dsh.profile.bundles`（`plugin-*.js`） | 需要 pnpm（dsh 官方要求）；**boot 不会自动 reconcile**，所以必须走 `dsh plugi"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"n add`，手动 `pnpm add` 不生效 |\n| 装载 | row 的 `name` 由 Node 内部加载器从 profile 目录解析（`mountRootInclude` / `cord"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"is-plugin-loader`），与官方 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app` 完全同路径 | 任意 OS 一致；纯 Cordis 插件，**无需 TYPERT 清单**（无 `."},{"id":"p12s5","text":"/typert` 导出的包会被 typert 注册表静默跳过，不报错） |\n| 契约 | 导出 `name` / `apply` / `config`；Cordis `unwrapExports` 兼"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"容具名导出；**无 `Config` 导出也可**（只在有 Config 时才校验） | 与官方插件同款写法 |\n| 错误语义 | `cordis-plugin-loader`：**任一插件 appl"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"y 抛错 = 整个 boot 失败**（`loader entries failed to apply`） | 本插件 apply() 全 try/catch、永不抛错 → 任何情况下都不会拖垮 `d"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"sh web` |\n| 服务读取 | `ctx.get(\"loader\").await()` + `ctx.get(\"webServer\").port`（官方 web-app 的 printUrl 同"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"款） | 任意 OS 一致；拿不到就降级 no-op + 警告 |\n| 打开浏览器 | win32 `cmd start`（走 `SystemRoot\\System32\\cmd.exe` 绝对路径，G"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"UI 启动 PATH 被裁剪也不怕）；darwin `/usr/bin/open`；linux `xdg-open` → `sensible-browser` → `google-chrome` → "},{"id":"p12s11","text":"`chromium` → `firefox` 逐级回退 | **v0.1.1 修复**：spawn 挂 error 监听 + 启动前 PATH 探测，缺 xdg-open 的 Linux 也不会崩（只"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"警告并打印链接） |\n| 编码 | 插件文件全部 UTF-8（JS/YAML），Node 与 js-yaml 原生支持 | 中/英/日文系统均无乱码问题 |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"已知边界（不是 bug，是环境事实）："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### What it looks like"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### What's in this repo (read before installing)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Part | Contents | Install | Platform |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **Plugin core** | `index.js` / `opener.js` / `cordis.patch.yml`: prints the URL and opens your bro"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"wser when `dsh web` is ready | `dsh plugin --profile web add @dawsondx/dsh-web-open` (or GitHub) | W"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"indows / macOS / Linux |\n| Optional: Windows launcher | `contrib/windows/dsh-web.cmd`: one-click sta"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"rt + checks for official updates | Copy it into a PATH dir yourself, or create a desktop shortcut | "},{"id":"p19s5","text":"Windows only |\n| Optional: Windows updater | `contrib/windows/dsh-update.cmd`: one-click harness upd"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"ate | Same as above | Windows only |\n| Optional: Unix shell fn | `contrib/unix/dsh-fn.sh`: `dsh` = `"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"dsh web` | Add to `~/.bashrc` / `~/.zshrc` | macOS / Linux |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Compatibility & update strategy"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"This plugin **deliberately** depends only on stable layers:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Dependency | Stability | If it breaks |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `@deepseek-ai/cordis` (peer, `>=4.0.0`) | Stable plugin core, independent versioning | Plugin won'"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"t load → dsh shows clear error, remove to recover |\n| dsh internal services `loader` / `webServer` |"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" May change during 0.1.0-rc | **Degrades gracefully**: prints warning, `dsh web` starts normally, ju"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"st won't auto-open |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Cross-platform compatibility (first-principles review)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Verified layer-by-layer against dsh 0.1.0-rc.6 source, not by assumption:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Layer | Actual mechanism (source basis) | Result |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Install | `dsh plugin --profile web add <pkg>` → pnpm installs into profile → **reconciles within "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"the command**, writing bundles that declare `dsh.bundle` into `dsh.profile.bundles` | Requires pnpm "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"(official requirement); **boot does NOT reconcile**, so `dsh plugin add` is mandatory — manual `pnpm"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" add` alone won't activate it |\n| Load | Row `name` resolves via Node's internal loader from the pro"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"file dir (`mountRootInclude` / `cordis-plugin-loader`) — the exact path official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-w"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"eb-app` uses | Same on every OS; plain Cordis plugin, **no TYPERT manifest needed** (packages withou"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"t a `./typert` export are silently skipped by the typert registry) |\n| Contract | Exports `name` / `"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"apply` / `config`; Cordis `unwrapExports` handles named exports; **`Config` export is optional** (va"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"lidated only when present) | Same writing style as official plugins |\n| Error semantics | `cordis-pl"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"ugin-loader`: **one plugin throwing in apply fails the whole boot** | This plugin's apply() is fully"},{"id":"p28s11","text":" wrapped in try/catch and never throws → can never take down `dsh web` |\n| Service reads | `ctx.get("},{"id":"p28s12","text":"\"loader\").await()` + `ctx.get(\"webServer\").port` (same pattern as the official web-app printUrl) | S"},{"id":"p28s13","text":"ame on every OS; degrades to no-op + warning if unavailable |\n| Opening the browser | win32 `cmd sta"},{"id":"p28s14","text":"rt` (absolute `SystemRoot\\System32\\cmd.exe`, safe even when PATH is stripped on GUI launch); darwin "},{"id":"p28s15","text":"`/usr/bin/open`; linux `xdg-open` → `sensible-browser` → `google-chrome` → `chromium` → `firefox` | "},{"id":"p28s16","text":"**Fixed in v0.1.1**: spawn error listener + PATH probing before launch — a Linux without `xdg-open` "},{"id":"p28s17","text":"warns and prints the link instead of crashing dsh |\n| Encoding | Plugin files are UTF-8 (JS/YAML); N"},{"id":"p28s18","text":"ode & js-yaml native | No mojibake on any locale |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Known environment boundaries (not bugs):"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
